  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The random variable&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math>&nbsp;follows binomial distribution <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, for which the difference of the mean and the variance is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
