    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that the difference between the mean and variance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Also given that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mi>p</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>p</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>4</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
  }
